1
00:00:09,566 --> 00:00:13,466
One little apple hanging in the tree,

2
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,533
Two little birds as happy as can be.

3
00:00:17,866 --> 00:00:21,733
Three rolling balls on the shiny floor,

4
00:00:21,966 --> 00:00:25,866
Four little kittens knocking at the door!

5
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,966
Five busy bees buzzing in the hive,

6
00:00:30,266 --> 00:00:32,300
Counting our friends,

7
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:38,400
one to five! One, two, three, four, five!

8
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:42,333
Watch our little numbers come alive!

9
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:46,400
Clap your hands and tap your shoe,

10
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:53,066
Counting is fun for me and you!

11
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:00,966
Six yellow ducks swimming in the lake,

12
00:01:01,266 --> 00:01:05,133
Seven sweet candles on a birthday cake!

13
00:01:05,466 --> 00:01:09,300
Eight tiny boats sailing far away,

14
00:01:09,466 --> 00:01:13,400
Nine colorful balloons floating up to play!

15
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,800
Ten shiny stars shining high and bright,

16
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,100
Lighting up the numbers in the night!

17
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:30,066
One, two, three, four, five! Six, seven, eight, nine, ten, alive!

18
00:01:30,266 --> 00:01:34,000
Clap your hands and tap your shoe,

19
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:41,000
Counting is fun for me and you!

20
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:52,033
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

21
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,866
We counted to ten! Yay!

